$DIR/main.p:7:7: hidden is not a variant of union dev.State (its variants are Off, On and hidden)
    A type switch on a union value, and a type assertion on one, name the
    union's own variants: U.V, or in a case of the switch the bare name V. A
    union value is never nil, and a variant of another union, or a type, can
    never match.
    A bare variant name is accepted only in the cases of a type switch, where
    the switch says which union is meant.
    (see "Unions" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.13)
    (run "pluto explain E2413" for a longer explanation)
